WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:03.113
That leadership requires a
high degree of versatility.

2
00:00:03.113 --> 00:00:06.490
I mean, you talk about, what was it,
command and control on one side,

3
00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:07.534
and what was the other side?

4
00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:09.662
Entrepreneurial and so on.

5
00:00:09.662 --> 00:00:12.665
We talk about it from a
tough love continuum, right?

6
00:00:12.665 --> 00:00:15.876
Command and control, directive,
authoritative on one side,

7
00:00:15.876 --> 00:00:18.712
and then the more compassionate collegial.

8
00:00:18.712 --> 00:00:21.466
But most of leadership
happens in between those two,

9
00:00:21.466 --> 00:00:26.095
and you got to calibrate by situation,
by person, by circumstance.

10
00:00:26.095 --> 00:00:29.131
And if you're not quick
at being able to do that,

11
00:00:29.131 --> 00:00:34.155
you're going to lose those authentic moments
that could really propel somebody and

12
00:00:34.155 --> 00:00:36.040
build a kind of trust that's necessary.

